Z||000016||Cheever3000||10-20-2001||12:18 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Immortal:<BR><B>Light little cars + street tires + 350 tpi= alot of tire burn. In turn loss of time, loss of HP and loss of speed.<P>12's are out of the question, not even with a 427Ci 350 HP</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE>Dude, I respect you standing your ground on this, but the ground beneath you is quicksand!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  Look at my brother's 68 Chevelle SS with a 396 -- it weighs a heck of a lot more than a Fiero and he got 11.4 @ 125 mph in the 1/4 on street tires!  <P>A Fiero with a 383 & street tires?  Yes, way!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P><BR>||||reg||1
